[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 900.23, "timestamp": "00:15:00", "text": "意思是，就像你選擇做這件事的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 916.829, "timestamp": "00:15:16", "text": "那天，也是我選擇真正向前邁進一步，變得更加自信，更加坦誠地面對自己，然後對自己說：“是啊，別做膽小鬼，你能行的。”就像如果你已經這樣做了一段時間，並且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 921.43, "timestamp": "00:15:21", "text": "嘗試聯繫你以前聯繫過的人，嘗試聯繫新人。是的。一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 932.949, "timestamp": "00:15:32", "text": "想和某人聯繫，對吧"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 945.461, "timestamp": "00:15:45", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "unless one thing is resolved the same thing will keep happening over and over again"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 949.99, "timestamp": "00:15:49", "text": "？  就像我創辦 Joathon 時一樣，我主要提到我想與我關係親近的創作者"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 953.914, "timestamp": "00:15:53", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "in your head*"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 959.269, "timestamp": "00:15:59", "text": "和朋友合作，也想與他們合作，並且以前也合作過，就像我在這段旅程中建立的所有聯繫一樣"}]